{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensory layer of play sensory layer of play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","fileName":"Sensory Layer of Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensory Layer of Play","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-21 00:27\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Player Experience Layers]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Player Experience Layers","Attention","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensory layer of play sensory layer of play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","fileName":"Sensory Layer of Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensory Layer of Play","heading":"Sensory Layer of Play","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The sensory layer is the player's immediate perception of a game through image, sound, touch, movement, and other bodily channels. It determines which signals are available before the player interprets what those signals mean.\n\nDesign at this layer directs [[Attention]] through contrast, rhythm, motion, volume, texture, and timing. A crucial state change that cannot be perceived cannot reliably support the higher informational and interactive layers.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Player Experience Layers","Attention","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensory layer of play sensory layer of play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensory Layer of Play.md","fileName":"Sensory Layer of Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensory Layer of Play","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[gamesdesignandplay.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Player Experience Layers","Attention","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}